<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>%Define Sample rate&#x000D;&#x000A;if MCS &gt; 12 &amp; MCS &lt; 25&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;Bandwidth_Hz = 2.0e9; %The actual bandwidth is 2.64e9*355/512 = 1.83e9 Hz&#x000D;&#x000A;    SampleRate = 2.64e9*2^OversampleRatio;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;ActiveOFDMFilter = 0;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;ActiveSCFilter = 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;else&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;Bandwidth_Hz = 1.76e9;&#x000D;&#x000A;    SampleRate = 1.76e9*2^OversampleRatio;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;ActiveOFDMFilter = 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;ActiveSCFilter = 0;&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
